    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert music identifier.\n\nInput: a string of text that represents transcribed audio. This text may be partial lyrics, noises, spoken hints about melody, mood, themes, instruments, rhythm, or other contextual details from a voice message.\n\nYour task:\n1) Identify the most likely song title.\n2) Identify the artist or band.\n3) Provide any alternative guesses if uncertain.\n4) Give a confidence level (0–100%) for your best guess.\n5) List specific lyrics or clues from the input that support that guess.\n\nOutput as strictly valid JSON with these keys:\n\n{\n  \"song_title\": \"string or null\",\n  \"artist\": \"string or null\",\n  \"confidence\": \"number (0–100)\",\n  \"alternatives\": [\n    { \"song_title\": \"string\", \"artist\": \"string\", \"confidence\": \"number (0–100)\" }\n  ],\n  \"supporting_clues\": [\n    \"description of a lyric or text snippet that led to that guess\",\n    ...\n  ]\n}\n\nIf you cannot identify the song with reasonable confidence, respond with `null` for song_title and artist, and confidence 0, but still follow the JSON schema.\n\nExample Input:\n\"I heard something like ‘don’t stop believin’ hold on to that feeling’ but it was distorted.\"\n\nExample Output:\n{\n  \"song_title\": \"Don’t Stop Believin’\",\n  \"artist\": \"Journey\",\n  \"confidence\": 92,\n  \"alternatives\": [\n    { \"song_title\": \"Don’t Stop\", \"artist\": \"Foo Fighters\", \"confidence\": 32 }\n  ],\n  \"supporting_clues\": [\n    \"The phrase ‘don’t stop believin’ matches a major lyric from the Journey song.\"\n  ]\n}\n\nNow identify the song from this transcript:\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\n{{ $json.data }}\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\n\nIMPORTANT: Output ONLY the raw JSON. Do NOT wrap in ```json``` or any extra text. Do NOT include any additional outer keys.",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1104,
        592
      ],
      "id": "a813ec52-04d3-43af-baec-b89ea63301ce",
